@startuml State_Diagram
title NET_SCAN — State Machine Diagram
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E8F4FD
  BorderColor #2196F3
  FontColor #000000
}

[*] --> Idle

state "Idle" as Idle : Waiting for user input
state "Scanning" as Scanning : Threads spawned
state "Port Discovery" as PD : TCP connect_ex() on each port
state "Banner Grabbing" as BG : recv() probe on OPEN ports
state "CVE Enrichment" as CVE : Querying NVD API v2.0
state "MITRE Mapping" as MITRE : Mapping techniques\n(T1048, T1210, T1572...)
state "Kill Chain\nClassification" as KC : Assigning Entry/Pivot/Target
state "Graph Generation" as GG : Building nodes & edges
state "Path Analysis" as PA : Running BFS + Dijkstra
state "NES Computation" as NES : Computing score (0-100)
state "Results Ready" as RR : Dashboard rendered
state "What-If Mode" as WI : Simulating port removal
state "Error" as Err : Connection failed

Idle --> Scanning : User clicks\n"Start Scan"
Scanning --> PD : Worker threads\ninitialized
PD --> PD : Port CLOSED\nor FILTERED
PD --> BG : Port OPEN\ndetected
BG --> CVE : All ports\nscanned
CVE --> MITRE : CVEs fetched\nfrom NVD
MITRE --> KC : Techniques\nmapped
KC --> GG : Roles\nassigned
GG --> PA : Graph\nbuilt
PA --> NES : BFS + Dijkstra\ncomplete
NES --> RR : Score\ncomputed

RR --> WI : User simulates\nport removal
WI --> RR : NES\nrecalculated
RR --> Idle : User starts\nnew scan
RR --> [*]

Scanning --> Err : Connection\nfailed / timeout
Err --> Idle : Reset

@enduml
